    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has become a habit for a streamer to update the video without time.   This streamer is not enterprising every day and is addicted to entertainment.   Suddenly one day, when the streamer woke up, everything around had changed, and all the sins would be liquidated at this moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the reason for all those things?   Who is the creator of this dungeon?   Where did the endless blades come from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These questions waiting for you to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a horizontal platform game, players can use the &quot;\u2191, \u2193, \u2190, \u2192&quot; button to control the character movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the final battle, player can press the &quot;Z&quot; key to use additional capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Production Team:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like this game or want to know more, please pay attention to the Bilibili ID:  \u4e9a\u91cc\u58eb\u5361\u620e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here special thanks to CV: \u82b1\u5b50\u7f0e\uff08\u5fae\u535a\uff1a@\u82b1\u5b50\u7f0e-\u8bdd\u6885\u7cd6\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And CV's dubbing club :\u00a0\uff08\u5fae\u535a\uff1a@\u4e00\u9897\u8bdd\u6885\u7cd6\u914d\u97f3\u793e\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, if anyone has the intention to cooperate with the game can also contact the game author, I hope everyone has a good game experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It has become a habit for a streamer to update the video without time.   This streamer is not enterprising every day and is addicted to entertainment.   Suddenly one day, when the streamer woke up, everything around had changed, and all the sins would be liquidated at this moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the reason for all those things?   Who is the creator of this dungeon?   Where did the endless blades come from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These questions waiting for you to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a horizontal platform game, players can use the &quot;\u2191, \u2193, \u2190, \u2192&quot; button to control the character movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the final battle, player can press the &quot;Z&quot; key to use additional capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Production Team:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like this game or want to know more, please pay attention to the Bilibili ID:  \u4e9a\u91cc\u58eb\u5361\u620e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here special thanks to CV: \u82b1\u5b50\u7f0e\uff08\u5fae\u535a\uff1a@\u82b1\u5b50\u7f0e-\u8bdd\u6885\u7cd6\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And CV's dubbing club :\u00a0\uff08\u5fae\u535a\uff1a@\u4e00\u9897\u8bdd\u6885\u7cd6\u914d\u97f3\u793e\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, if anyone has the intention to cooperate with the game can also contact the game author, I hope everyone has a good game experience.</p>",
